    <BaseHead title="Notes | Ezra Crocker" description="Technical notes and explanations by Ezra Crocker" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <Header />
    <main>
	<h1>Blog</h1>

	<p>
		This section will contain longer technical posts, study reflections, and explanations of
		networking and infrastructure concepts I am learning or documenting.
	</p>

	<p>
		The focus of this blog is network engineering, infrastructure troubleshooting, cloud,
		automation, security, and the process of becoming a stronger technical professional.
	</p>

	<h2>Planned Posts</h2>

	<ul>
		<li>What I Learned Building This Site with Astro, GitHub, and Cloudflare Pages</li>
		<li>DHCP, Static IPs, and Reservations Explained</li>
		<li>What Happens During a TLS Handshake?</li>
		<li>How VLANs Help Segment a Network</li>
	</ul>
</main>